@startuml eMarket
' Data Flow Diagram: Admin Manages Users and System Monitoring

actor Admin

rectangle "Frontend (Vue.js)" as FE {
  [Admin UI]
}

rectangle "Backend (Node.js/Express)" as BE {
  [User Controller]
  [Admin Controller]
  [User Service]
  [Admin Service]
  [Supabase Integration]
}

database "Supabase DB" as DB

' Admin manages users
Admin --> [Admin UI] : View/manage users
[Admin UI] --> [User Controller] : GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /users
[User Controller] --> [User Service] : manageUser(admin, userData)
[User Service] --> [Supabase Integration] : Query/update user data
[Supabase Integration] --> DB : SQL Select/Insert/Update/Delete
[User Service] --> [User Controller] : Success/Failure/Data
[User Controller] --> [Admin UI] : API Response

' Admin system monitoring
Admin --> [Admin UI] : View system stats/logs
[Admin UI] --> [Admin Controller] : GET /system/monitor
[Admin Controller] --> [Admin Service] : getSystemStats()
[Admin Service] --> [Supabase Integration] : Query logs/statistics
[Supabase Integration] --> DB : SQL Select
[Admin Service] --> [Admin Controller] : Stats/logs data
[Admin Controller] --> [Admin UI] : API Response (stats/logs)

@enduml
